2026-09-09 03:36:05,088 [INFO]     MORNING_WIN_START (09:15) and MORNING_WIN_END (10:15): if a closed FUT 15m
2026-09-09 03:36:05,088 [INFO]     bar crosses its VWAP (body 65-86%) AND its close is > MORNING_VWAP_SR_MIN_DIST
2026-09-09 03:36:05,088 [INFO]     (20pt) from every pivot S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Re-entries
2026-09-09 03:36:05,088 [INFO]     per momentum gate. Uses engine 'VWAP' (so it inherits the VWAP option-VWAP
