2026-09-09 03:36:05,088 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: this only ADDS the pre-09:45 window; from 09:45 on, the
2026-09-09 03:36:05,088 [INFO]     normal engines (incl. Feature 1) already run. No confirmation candle is
