2026-09-09 03:36:05,097 [INFO]          (scratchpad/wfhtest/repro3.py): FileHandler -> on-disk log holds ONLY
2026-09-09 03:36:05,097 [INFO]          the boot banner (inode swapped mid-run); WatchedFileHandler -> all
2026-09-09 03:36:05,097 [INFO]          lines through EOD survive the identical swap. Control that confirms
2026-09-09 03:36:05,097 [INFO]          the diagnosis in production: stocks_run.log is NOT git-tracked, is
2026-09-09 03:36:05,097 [INFO]          never touched by the push, and is complete through 15:30 IST on the
2026-09-09 03:36:05,097 [INFO]          same sessions. csv_append() and the Telegram fallback log open by
